: Graph-resident StageR 3 (Dc f657) implementation of
: Dc 2608 "Convert Dc string to WASM".
:
: Compiles an arbitrary quoted Dc document (`[Dc 2608 [string]]`) into a
: `Dc 1927`..`Dc 1928` (`[wasm_program]`) executable token sequence via the
: Option B `Dc 1939` (System graph query) and `Dc 1940` (pure WASM child
: execution) host capability protocol, without performing host Rust graph
: resolution or converter execution.

ns std/convert_dc_string_to_wasm.

use std/dcs:
    dcsToList dcsFromList dcFromUnicode
::.

use std/dctf:
    skipComments readEscapedLiteral tokEscapedLiteral readIdentBytes
::.

: ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
: 0. Internal Result & Domain Types
: ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

