: Encodes a segment list into canonical `Dc 511 f229` FilePath tokens
: (`segMode`: `0` = raw inline segments, `1` = `[string]`-interned IDs,
: `2` = legacy Unicode-interned IDs; `hdrMode`: `0` = `516 f228 513`, `1` = `516 f228`,
: `2` = omit `516 f228`).
